    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Get ready for an adrenaline-fueled adventure in Fractured Horizon! Master gravity-defying parkour and harness the power of Gravity Fields to mend a shattered world. Race against time, challenge your skills, and unveil ancient secrets as you leap, run, and solve puzzles in this breathtaking first-person platformer. Are you up for the challenge? Dive into the fractured world and rewrite its destiny!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704280/extras/f8443885a8f659b87a0a3f8142daafe5.avif?t=1713016411\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Seamlessly traverse the fractured landscape as you leap between platforms. Use and manipulate gravity fields. Bend the law of physics to your advantage. Overcome obstacles that stand between you and the secrets of this fractured world. The ability to control gravity is in your hands - use it wisely.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704280/extras/af372899ef3fa3e9d5cd809fefe626c0.poster.avif?t=1713016411\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704280/extras/af372899ef3fa3e9d5cd809fefe626c0.webm?t=1713016411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704280/extras/af372899ef3fa3e9d5cd809fefe626c0.mp4?t=1713016411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704280/extras/24be877ebea5c1800ecaa1092dbf2c46.avif?t=1713016411\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Fractured Horizon is not just about mastering gravity; it's about doing it with speed and precision. Test your reflexes, beat the clock, and discover what awaits at the end of each adrenaline-filled race.<br><br>Your journey begins now. Dive into fractured Horizon, rewrite the destiny of a shatterd world, and leave your mark on a gravity-defying adventure like no other. The fractures are waiting to be mended, the secrets yearn to be unveiled - are you ready to be the driving force behind change?<br><br>This game is made by 6 students from Howest - Digital Arts &amp; Entertainment in the 3rd year of their bachelor in a period of 11 weeks.",
