aline-filled race.<br><br>Your journey begins now. Dive into fractured Horizon, rewrite the destiny of a shatterd world, and leave your mark on a gravity-defying adventure like no other. The fractures are waiting to be mended, the secrets yearn to be unveiled - are you ready to be the driving force behind change?<br><br>This game is made by 6 students from Howest - Digital Arts &amp; Entertainment in the 3rd year of their bachelor in a period of 11 weeks.",
